                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>يَعْتَذِرُوْنَ إلَيْكُمْ إِذَا رَجَغْتُم  إِلَيْهِمْ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#15v">-15v</locus>إِنَّهُ عَلِيْمٌ بِذًاتِ الصُّدُوْرِ</explicit>
                     <note>9:94-11:5. The order of the folios disrupted: fol. 14 should be placed after fol. 1. Curve of final nūn-s, sīn-s and yā'-s semi-circular; curve of final 'ayn-s and ḥā'-s as well. Ihmāl marks (ḥā’-s, ‘ayn-s). Red dots as verse markers. Some extensions of words into the margin. Words left uncompleted at the end of a line, without diacritic or vocalization, and written in full on the following line. Catchwords from another hand, more recent than the matn, and casual; some were deleted (4v). The height of the block of quires is higher that that of the binding. Text on fol. 15v damaged by damp.</note>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
